WEBVTT

00:06.006 --> 00:10.010
[theme music]

00:26.568 --> 00:27.610
Untie me.

00:30.780 --> 00:31.781
What?

00:33.575 --> 00:35.952
You still can't beat me in a fair fight?

00:44.544 --> 00:46.963
You still have that look in your eyes.

00:49.382 --> 00:51.176
Like you fear nothing.

00:54.763 --> 00:57.098
[groaning]

00:58.641 --> 00:59.684
[grunts]

01:02.103 --> 01:03.813
[snickers]
Now, this look I like.

01:03.897 --> 01:04.898
[Jiwoo groans]

01:05.732 --> 01:06.691
[grunts]

01:09.027 --> 01:11.154
[Daesoo] Listen,
Mango doesn't know anyone.

01:11.237 --> 01:12.238
[Gunpyeong] Captain.

01:13.323 --> 01:14.991
I can't reach Detective Jeon.

01:15.075 --> 01:17.077
He asked me to look up a location…

01:17.160 --> 01:17.994
And?

01:18.078 --> 01:20.371
And his phone was turned off
right after he arrived.

01:21.206 --> 01:22.332
[grunts]

01:22.415 --> 01:24.876
[Cheolho breathes heavily]

01:25.960 --> 01:28.046
- [cell phone vibrating]
- [Cheolho groaning]

01:30.924 --> 01:32.217
[Gangjae] Did you get him?

01:32.300 --> 01:33.760
Hello, Gangjae.

01:33.843 --> 01:35.303
[Jiwoo groans]

01:35.386 --> 01:36.429
Oh.

01:38.014 --> 01:40.016
Those idiots.
[sighs]

01:42.060 --> 01:43.603
I knew you'd come here.

01:43.686 --> 01:45.438
[Gangjae laughs]

01:45.522 --> 01:47.649
[Gangjae] Well, I didn't wanna go
empty-handed,

01:47.732 --> 01:50.235
so I've been preparing a gift for you.

01:51.569 --> 01:53.363
- [camera shutter clicks]
- Look here.

01:53.446 --> 01:57.075
- [camera shutter clicking]
- [Gangjae chuckling]

01:57.158 --> 02:00.203
OH HYEJIN

02:03.206 --> 02:04.249
[Gangjae] Hurry up.

02:04.332 --> 02:06.334
[chuckles]
There isn't much time.

02:07.293 --> 02:09.129
If you wanna get a corpse.

02:09.212 --> 02:10.255
[Jiwoo yelps]

02:11.506 --> 02:14.008
[Jiwoo grunting]

02:15.093 --> 02:17.804
[Gangjae] You thought you were
something special, didn't you?

02:17.887 --> 02:19.556
- [breathes heavily]
- [Gangjae] You are…

02:20.348 --> 02:22.433
[whispers]
…absolutely nothing.

02:23.017 --> 02:24.686
Let Detective Jeon go.

02:25.603 --> 02:27.480
He has nothing to do with this.

02:27.564 --> 02:29.107
[Jiwoo breathes heavily]

02:29.983 --> 02:31.442
[Jiwoo groans]

02:31.526 --> 02:32.944
[Gangjae] How about you…

02:33.736 --> 02:38.408
just worry about
what I'm about to do to you.

02:39.701 --> 02:41.870
I'll play with you all night long.

02:42.579 --> 02:44.789
[laughing]

02:45.915 --> 02:48.293
[laughing continues]

02:53.089 --> 02:55.466
Aargh! Goddamn!

02:58.636 --> 03:01.806
I wanted Choi Mujin to watch you die!

03:01.890 --> 03:02.932
Detective!

03:03.641 --> 03:06.102
Hey. Say your final words.

03:07.061 --> 03:08.521
I'll relay it for you.

03:11.357 --> 03:13.443
I'll kill you as soon as I can.

03:15.403 --> 03:18.156
[chuckling]

03:18.907 --> 03:20.491
[snickers]

03:20.575 --> 03:21.743
[smooches]

03:22.744 --> 03:23.786
Do it.

03:30.877 --> 03:32.128
[breathes heavily]

03:41.387 --> 03:43.848
[Gangjae laughing]

03:45.016 --> 03:47.310
[Gangjae] This must hurt like hell.

03:49.103 --> 03:50.772
As I crushed you,

03:50.855 --> 03:52.649
your skull will crack open

03:53.316 --> 03:55.860
- and your brain will ooze out.
- [clanks]

03:55.944 --> 03:58.696
[snickering]

03:58.780 --> 04:00.240
It would be fun to watch,

04:00.323 --> 04:02.242
but I don't have the time.

04:04.869 --> 04:05.995
See ya.

04:11.042 --> 04:13.002
- [machine powering up]
- [alarm blaring]

04:17.048 --> 04:18.258
Wake up, Pildo!

04:22.136 --> 04:23.429
- [thuds]
- [Pildo and Jiwoon groan]

04:24.055 --> 04:25.098
[moans]

04:25.848 --> 04:27.058
[pants]

04:29.185 --> 04:32.647
[machine whirring]

04:40.530 --> 04:41.406
[thuds]

04:43.992 --> 04:46.494
[groaning]

04:49.080 --> 04:50.665
[rattling]

04:51.958 --> 04:53.710
- [Pildo groans]
- [thwacks]

04:55.086 --> 04:56.546
[Pildo] Gangjae!

04:59.590 --> 05:01.342
[breathes heavily]

05:01.426 --> 05:04.429
[sirens wailing in distance]

05:08.224 --> 05:10.310
[breathing heavily]

05:10.393 --> 05:13.229
[sirens wailing]

05:16.065 --> 05:16.941
[smashes]

05:17.525 --> 05:19.110
- [grunts]
- [groans]

05:23.031 --> 05:24.073
[loud clank]

05:24.157 --> 05:25.533
[metal creaks]

05:25.616 --> 05:26.826
[glass shatters]

05:26.909 --> 05:29.370
[metal creaking]

05:32.373 --> 05:33.750
[glass shatters]

05:42.717 --> 05:44.927
[grunting]

05:47.847 --> 05:49.682
[metal creaking]

05:49.766 --> 05:50.600
[yelps]

05:50.683 --> 05:51.684
[grunts]

05:51.768 --> 05:52.852
[Pildo] Get out.

05:53.436 --> 05:54.645
Get out now!

05:56.022 --> 05:57.899
- [machine whirring]
- [glass shatters]

05:58.649 --> 05:59.817
[Jiwoo groans]

06:01.152 --> 06:04.364
[both grunting]

06:04.447 --> 06:06.407
[Pildo and Jiwoo groan]

06:07.950 --> 06:08.951
[screams]

06:09.827 --> 06:11.204
[groans]

06:11.287 --> 06:13.414
[horn honking]

06:13.498 --> 06:14.749
- [crashes]
- [machine powers down]

06:14.832 --> 06:15.875
[Jiwoo groans]

06:15.958 --> 06:18.002
[electricity crackling]

06:18.669 --> 06:20.588
[Jiwoon groaning]

06:20.671 --> 06:22.715
[Pildo moaning]

06:23.674 --> 06:26.135
[Jiwoo breathes heavily]

06:27.345 --> 06:28.471
[Pildo moans]

06:34.310 --> 06:35.520
[Pildo grunts]

06:37.980 --> 06:39.607
[Pildo groans]

06:39.690 --> 06:44.070
[police siren wailing in distance]

06:45.530 --> 06:46.572
[Pildo groans]

06:47.323 --> 06:49.075
- [coughs]
- [Pildo grunts]

06:50.993 --> 06:52.036
[Pildo moans]

06:55.998 --> 06:57.583
- [crackling]
- [grunts]

06:57.667 --> 07:00.128
- [machine powering up]
- [alarm blaring]

07:01.546 --> 07:02.797
- [Jiwoo] Pildo!
- [Pildo grunts]

07:04.966 --> 07:06.592
[alarm blaring]

07:07.468 --> 07:08.594
- [grunts]
- [crackling]

07:08.678 --> 07:10.888
- [alarm blaring]
- [grunting]

07:10.972 --> 07:12.473
- [machine powers down]
- [Jiwoo] Pildo!

07:12.557 --> 07:15.768
[breathing heavily]

07:19.647 --> 07:21.274
- Gosh!
- [Jiwoo grunts]

07:21.357 --> 07:22.608
[Jiwoo] Pildo!

07:22.692 --> 07:23.526
OH HYEJIN

07:24.485 --> 07:28.072
[sirens wailing]

07:30.575 --> 07:31.576
[Daesoo] Pildo!

07:32.535 --> 07:33.536
Oh, my god.

07:33.619 --> 07:34.662
[Gunpyeong] Pildo.

07:35.204 --> 07:36.122
How did you get here?

07:36.205 --> 07:37.415
- I'm serious.
- [groans]

07:38.291 --> 07:39.250
[Pildo] Damn it.

07:41.085 --> 07:43.504
- [exhales deeply]
- [Daesoo] A detective gets handcuffed.

07:43.588 --> 07:44.630
Good going.

07:45.965 --> 07:47.717
You crazy bastard. Get up.

07:49.093 --> 07:51.095
[Pildo groaning]

07:52.096 --> 07:54.223
Why does it feel nice being cursed at?

07:56.142 --> 07:57.268
You okay?

07:57.351 --> 07:58.311
Yeah.

07:59.103 --> 08:00.188
- I'm okay.
- [Pildo] Hey.

08:00.271 --> 08:01.606
Hey, hey!

08:01.689 --> 08:05.651
[police siren wailing in distance]

08:07.195 --> 08:09.906
[panting]

08:12.450 --> 08:13.534
[groans]

08:16.662 --> 08:17.663
[sniffs]

08:41.854 --> 08:43.064
Are you all right, sir?

08:43.814 --> 08:44.690
[sighs]

08:49.487 --> 08:50.947
Why did you go alone?

08:53.991 --> 08:55.952
Gangjae attempted to kill Jiwoo.

08:57.203 --> 08:58.079
[scoffs]

08:59.163 --> 09:00.498
So because of Jiwoo.

09:04.460 --> 09:05.878
You could have been killed.

09:13.261 --> 09:14.887
Jiwoo shot the gun on the ship.

09:19.058 --> 09:21.894
She perform the action
at the risk of exposing herself.

09:25.982 --> 09:27.191
What did you do?

09:28.526 --> 09:29.402
Huh?

09:31.654 --> 09:32.697
Taeju.

09:34.740 --> 09:35.783
Taeju!

09:42.498 --> 09:43.916
Can you be trusted?

09:49.005 --> 09:49.839
[gasps]

09:51.132 --> 09:52.258
I'm sorry, sir.

09:59.140 --> 10:03.477
[retreating footsteps]

10:04.604 --> 10:06.397
[Daesoo] She's in surgery right now.

10:06.480 --> 10:07.356
Hold on.

10:08.899 --> 10:10.192
How long will the surgery take?

10:10.901 --> 10:12.028
We don't know yet.

10:12.111 --> 10:14.363
We have to catch that asshole Do Gangjae.

10:15.531 --> 10:17.116
You go and get some treatment first.

10:18.909 --> 10:21.245
We can catch punks
like Do Gangjae whenever.

10:21.329 --> 10:23.205
That asshole stabbed my partner!

10:23.289 --> 10:24.582
Pildo!

10:28.210 --> 10:30.004
I choose to trust Detective Oh.

10:32.381 --> 10:33.883
[crutch clatters]

10:37.762 --> 10:38.763
[sighs]

10:40.348 --> 10:41.974
[inhales sharply]

10:55.571 --> 10:56.614
[safety box beeps]

11:00.368 --> 11:03.162
[indistinct chatter]

11:44.078 --> 11:46.080
[somber music]

11:55.548 --> 11:56.590
Sir…

11:57.299 --> 12:00.261
we can't send my team out
with those psychos running lose.

12:00.344 --> 12:02.471
[commissioner] All Narcotics members
will carry firearms

12:02.555 --> 12:04.640
until the situation is resolved.

12:05.307 --> 12:06.517
- [Daesoo] Hello.
- [man 1] Hello.

12:06.600 --> 12:07.893
- [Daesoo] Police.
- [man 1] Yes.

12:07.977 --> 12:10.020
Can I take a look
at the video on that camera?

12:12.606 --> 12:13.899
Have you seen this man?

12:15.025 --> 12:16.527
[woman] Girls. Come over here.

12:16.610 --> 12:18.195
[Pildo] Look at this.

12:18.279 --> 12:20.948
This is Do Gangjae and Kim Cheolho.

12:21.031 --> 12:22.575
Have you seen them?

12:22.658 --> 12:24.660
[chains rattling]

12:34.670 --> 12:35.921
[Cheolho groans]

12:37.339 --> 12:38.716
[coughs]

12:39.341 --> 12:41.635
[groaning]

12:41.719 --> 12:45.264
- Where's Gangjae?
- [Cheolho] I don't know!

12:45.848 --> 12:49.351
Burn in hell, you motherfuckers!

12:49.935 --> 12:51.896
The result isn't going to change.

12:52.605 --> 12:56.108
You can end it quickly
or you can let it drag out.

12:56.734 --> 12:58.861
[tense music]

13:26.055 --> 13:27.515
[distant horn honks]

13:35.981 --> 13:37.817
Let's not waste our energy.

13:40.402 --> 13:41.529
[mumbles]

13:42.696 --> 13:44.949
[inaudible]

13:45.032 --> 13:47.868
[doorbell ringing]

13:47.952 --> 13:48.953
[Gunpyeong grunts]

13:49.912 --> 13:51.497
- [indistinct chatter]
- [thugs groan]

13:51.580 --> 13:53.249
- [grunts]
- [gunshot]

13:53.332 --> 13:55.251
- Stay still, assholes.
- Sons of bitches!

13:55.835 --> 13:57.837
- [groans]
- You have the right to remain silent.

13:57.920 --> 13:59.255
You have the right to an attorney.

13:59.338 --> 14:00.881
You have the right to remain silent.

14:00.965 --> 14:02.550
- [Pildo] But don't do that.
- [cocks gun]

14:02.633 --> 14:04.093
Because I'm pissed off.

14:06.887 --> 14:10.140
[upbeat music playing]

14:14.645 --> 14:16.605
[indistinct chatter]

14:19.692 --> 14:22.194
[gun clicking]

14:43.716 --> 14:45.092
I'm sorry, sir. Gangjae…

14:59.189 --> 15:00.149
Have you eaten?

15:01.901 --> 15:03.152
No, sir. Not yet.

15:03.694 --> 15:04.862
Want samgyetang?

15:06.447 --> 15:07.448
Yes, sir.

15:08.198 --> 15:09.450
We used to go there often.

15:09.992 --> 15:11.076
Simakse.

15:11.660 --> 15:12.661
Yes, sir.

15:20.502 --> 15:21.545
[Mujin] Right.

15:22.296 --> 15:23.964
You had a thing for their daughter.

15:25.424 --> 15:26.550
No, sir.

15:26.634 --> 15:27.801
Guess it didn't work out.

15:30.137 --> 15:31.513
It wasn't anything, sir.

15:40.606 --> 15:41.857
I know you're trying.

15:48.989 --> 15:50.908
Let's see what Narcotics does next.

15:53.327 --> 15:55.537
Gangjae will show up
if driven to a corner.

15:56.163 --> 15:57.247
[Taeju] Yes, sir.

16:03.253 --> 16:06.006
[waves splashing]

16:11.553 --> 16:12.763
Papa.

16:15.849 --> 16:16.892
Papa!

16:21.730 --> 16:23.774
[dramatic music]

16:28.821 --> 16:29.738
Papa.

16:30.280 --> 16:31.615
- Papa?
- [door rattles]

16:31.699 --> 16:33.283
Papa, open the door.

16:33.367 --> 16:34.618
[grunts]

16:45.129 --> 16:46.714
[door creaks]

16:48.757 --> 16:51.552
[breathing heavily]

16:57.391 --> 16:58.350
[panting]

16:58.434 --> 17:00.352
[rattling]

17:05.774 --> 17:06.734
Papa!

17:07.901 --> 17:08.986
Papa!

17:09.653 --> 17:11.488
Papa! Don't go!

17:11.572 --> 17:13.615
Please don't leave me here alone!

17:13.699 --> 17:16.660
[breathing heavily]
Papa!

17:18.829 --> 17:20.998
Papa! Don't go!

17:21.081 --> 17:22.958
[Jiwoo sobs]
Papa!

17:23.042 --> 17:25.377
[Jiwoo whimpering]

17:30.090 --> 17:32.634
[breathes heavily]

17:34.219 --> 17:35.345
[gasps]

17:35.429 --> 17:37.848
[whimpering]

17:39.975 --> 17:41.143
Are you okay?

17:46.231 --> 17:47.191
[Jiwoo groans]

17:47.775 --> 17:49.151
[breathes heavily]

17:49.234 --> 17:51.028
You scowl even when you sleep.

17:53.072 --> 17:54.073
[sighs deeply]

17:55.282 --> 17:57.034
You won't last long like that.

18:01.163 --> 18:03.165
I used to live for revenge like you do.

18:06.919 --> 18:08.378
I had a little sister.

18:10.005 --> 18:12.674
She went clubbing
to celebrate getting into college,

18:13.801 --> 18:15.302
her beer was drugged.

18:17.221 --> 18:18.597
She died right then.

18:21.850 --> 18:23.310
She had a weak heart.

18:27.481 --> 18:29.233
Did they catch who did it?

18:29.900 --> 18:30.776
No.

18:31.276 --> 18:33.445
[scoffs]
Don't know who it was.

18:35.197 --> 18:38.200
If we catch all the drug dealers
and drug ring members,

18:38.742 --> 18:40.160
he'll probably be among them.

18:45.499 --> 18:47.543
I don't know who it is you wanna catch,

18:49.419 --> 18:50.587
but I'll help you.

18:51.505 --> 18:52.714
Let's get him together.

19:00.681 --> 19:01.807
Here's some clothes.

19:01.890 --> 19:03.142
I'll get your papers done.

19:06.979 --> 19:09.857
[door opens, closes]

19:16.113 --> 19:17.656
How're you doing? You okay?

19:20.450 --> 19:21.451
Touch this.

19:23.328 --> 19:24.454
Touch right here.

19:28.000 --> 19:29.251
So awesome, right?

19:30.752 --> 19:31.837
[sighs]

19:31.920 --> 19:33.422
The bump won't go down.

19:34.590 --> 19:36.842
One centimeter over,
and I would have died.

19:36.925 --> 19:37.926
God.

19:38.886 --> 19:40.721
Your hand is covered in scars.

19:45.434 --> 19:46.894
Because I was a coward.

19:51.440 --> 19:52.524
Not anymore.

19:53.275 --> 19:54.860
When I first joined Narcotics…

19:56.945 --> 19:58.322
When someone had a knife,

19:59.281 --> 20:00.490
I used my hands.

20:30.395 --> 20:31.897
[Daesoo] Detective Oh! Hey.

20:31.980 --> 20:33.815
[Daesoo chuckles]

20:33.899 --> 20:35.442
Let's go inside. It's cold.

20:41.114 --> 20:42.282
[exhales deeply]

20:43.033 --> 20:43.909
After getting stabbed,

20:43.992 --> 20:45.827
you need to fill
that hole with meat, you know.

20:46.662 --> 20:49.081
We're using our remaining
team outing budget.

20:50.165 --> 20:52.834
Hold on, Detective Oh
should be drinking something warm.

20:52.918 --> 20:53.835
Here.

20:55.212 --> 20:56.255
What is that?

20:56.922 --> 20:58.548
It's some chamomile tea.

20:58.632 --> 21:00.509
Nice, Gunpyeong.

21:00.592 --> 21:02.135
Chamomile.
[chuckles]

21:02.219 --> 21:03.887
- Just grill the meat properly.
- Yes, sir.

21:03.971 --> 21:05.430
Detective Oh's hungry.

21:05.514 --> 21:07.891
Well done or medium? Which do you like?

21:08.600 --> 21:09.643
Daesoo is too unrefined

21:09.726 --> 21:11.812
and can't eat this
unless it's fully cooked.

21:11.895 --> 21:14.106
[Daesoo] Yeah, right. I eat beef tartare.

21:14.189 --> 21:15.565
You punk.

21:15.649 --> 21:17.484
Don't make her laugh. It'll hurt.

21:17.567 --> 21:19.069
- [Gunpyeong] Sorry.
- [Daesoo chuckles]

21:19.152 --> 21:21.238
- [grill sizzles]
- [glass clanking]

21:23.949 --> 21:25.033
You're a miracle.

21:25.117 --> 21:26.702
You're back with all of us.

21:26.785 --> 21:27.703
Oh Hyejin.

21:32.791 --> 21:33.709
Cheers.

21:36.211 --> 21:38.255
[Daesoo and Pildo exhale deeply]

21:40.132 --> 21:41.883
What meat is this?

21:41.967 --> 21:43.760
[Daesoo] That's beef and that's mushroom.

21:45.512 --> 21:46.388
Flip this.

21:52.978 --> 21:55.230
[camera shutter clicking]

22:05.157 --> 22:06.700
Mr. Choi. It's me.

22:07.576 --> 22:08.952
I know where Jiwoo is.

22:11.830 --> 22:13.623
We need to send someone out.

22:16.668 --> 22:17.711
Who is she?

22:23.008 --> 22:24.259
A friend's daughter.

22:25.177 --> 22:27.429
Book a flight
and find her a place to live.

22:29.723 --> 22:31.224
A house on the beach.

22:34.019 --> 22:35.228
I'll do that now, sir.

22:41.151 --> 22:43.153
[somber music]

23:02.964 --> 23:03.965
CHOI MUJIN, CEO OF HOTEL LIBER

23:04.049 --> 23:05.342
CHARGED FOR DRUGS AND ASSAULT,
DONGCHEON

23:13.058 --> 23:15.060
[somber music continues]

23:19.231 --> 23:20.273
[sighs]

23:29.199 --> 23:30.158
[sniffles]

23:31.743 --> 23:33.620
[cell phone vibrating]

23:39.251 --> 23:41.086
[vibrating continues]

23:42.671 --> 23:43.839
[inhales sharply]

23:44.589 --> 23:46.049
Shut it down and get out of there.

23:47.175 --> 23:49.469
[Mujin] I'll make preparations
so you can leave the country.

23:50.053 --> 23:51.221
I can't do that.

23:52.889 --> 23:53.807
[Mujin] Jiwoo.

23:54.641 --> 23:56.143
I still got to check on something.

23:56.226 --> 23:57.269
[Mujin] Yoon Jiwoo!

23:58.937 --> 23:59.980
Do as I say.

24:01.106 --> 24:03.150
If they capture him, you'll be in danger.

24:05.902 --> 24:07.446
I'm gonna take care of it.

24:09.906 --> 24:10.991
[beeps]

24:27.632 --> 24:29.217
[door closes]

24:29.301 --> 24:31.261
[Gunpyeong] Captain.
You wanted to see me?

24:35.599 --> 24:37.476
Check out this number.

24:37.559 --> 24:40.687
Get all calls made, received,
and where it's been the last three weeks.

24:40.770 --> 24:41.646
[Gunpyeong] Yes, sir.

24:42.314 --> 24:44.232
OH HYEJIN

24:45.108 --> 24:46.318
It's classified.

24:47.277 --> 24:48.361
[Gunpyeong] Yes, sir.

24:51.531 --> 24:54.618
[siren wailing in distance]

24:58.497 --> 25:00.999
- [man 1 sighs]
- [Daesoo] Asshole, get going.

25:01.082 --> 25:03.335
- [man 2 grunts]
- [detective 1] Have a nice day.

25:04.085 --> 25:05.670
I'll walk on my own.

25:05.754 --> 25:07.047
- What?
- Let's get you processed.

25:07.130 --> 25:08.298
Hey.

25:09.007 --> 25:10.133
What are you doing here?

25:10.217 --> 25:12.010
We said to take a few more days off.

25:12.093 --> 25:13.470
Cabin fever.

25:13.553 --> 25:15.388
We'll catch Do Gangjae soon.

25:19.976 --> 25:23.188
Hey, they want us to carry firearms.
Pick up your gun.

25:23.271 --> 25:25.232
- Okay.
- [Cha Giho] I got it, punk.

25:25.315 --> 25:26.733
[detective 2] Here. You forgot this.

25:26.816 --> 25:27.817
Thanks.

25:29.778 --> 25:30.946
You're here.

25:31.905 --> 25:32.948
Are you okay?

25:33.448 --> 25:34.783
I'm doing fine, sir.

25:35.575 --> 25:36.910
[Sergeant Cho] Captain Cha.

25:37.827 --> 25:39.246
[Cha Giho] Hey. Come in.

25:39.746 --> 25:42.165
[ominous music]

25:43.333 --> 25:45.835
[Sergeant Cho] Jiwoo.
Did you hear from your dad?

25:49.256 --> 25:51.424
What did you say that make him come home?

25:55.554 --> 25:56.763
OH HYEJIN

25:58.765 --> 26:00.433
It's really good to see you again.

26:03.770 --> 26:04.938
Do you know her?

26:08.108 --> 26:09.234
Yes.

26:09.317 --> 26:11.945
I saw her a few times
when she was with Violent Crimes.

26:12.904 --> 26:14.281
She's a good worker.

26:15.574 --> 26:16.575
[scoffs]

26:17.367 --> 26:18.451
Come on.

26:34.217 --> 26:35.468
Detective Oh.

26:35.969 --> 26:37.053
We should…

26:37.887 --> 26:39.180
grab dinner soon.

26:48.690 --> 26:50.900
[suspenseful music]

27:01.286 --> 27:03.121
Yoon Donghoon's daughter…

27:05.040 --> 27:06.666
[Cha Giho] Did you find out anything else?

27:09.794 --> 27:11.212
No, she's just nowhere.

27:12.255 --> 27:14.716
She vanished
after the thing with her father.

27:17.344 --> 27:18.511
[Sergeant Cho] Why do you ask?

27:22.265 --> 27:24.184
The missing gun was at a crime scene.

27:28.313 --> 27:29.356
Yoon Donghoon's gun?

27:38.865 --> 27:42.160
VIOLENT CRIMES TEAM 3
SERGEANT CHO JINSAE

27:42.994 --> 27:45.080
[Ms. Kang] I've narrowed it down
to two places.

27:48.416 --> 27:49.250
[door opens]

27:50.210 --> 27:51.753
[approaching footsteps]

27:54.381 --> 27:56.466
Cho Jinsae met with Cha Giho.

28:10.146 --> 28:14.401
INCHANG METROPOLITAN POLICE AGENCY

28:19.239 --> 28:21.241
Are you still looking
for your dad's killer?

28:22.409 --> 28:23.743
Why did you lie?

28:25.495 --> 28:27.372
[inhales sharply]
Hmm.

28:31.042 --> 28:33.670
Because something entertaining
seems to be going on.

28:39.134 --> 28:40.552
Here. I got a tip for you.

28:42.053 --> 28:43.138
Your dad's case…

28:43.888 --> 28:45.682
got buried by Cha Giho.

28:46.224 --> 28:47.517
Interesting, huh?

28:49.811 --> 28:51.062
I heard a gun was found.

28:52.147 --> 28:53.565
Is Cha Giho the killer?

28:54.190 --> 28:56.443
[tense music]

28:56.526 --> 28:58.278
If you tell anyone about who I am…

28:58.361 --> 29:00.321
[Sergeant Cho] What would I gain
from exposing you?

29:00.905 --> 29:02.449
Just a pain in the ass.

29:03.241 --> 29:04.117
[sniffs]

29:05.160 --> 29:06.244
Best of luck.

29:09.164 --> 29:10.165
[car door closes]

29:10.248 --> 29:12.041
[car engine starts]

29:16.129 --> 29:18.381
[engine revving]

29:29.684 --> 29:32.812
[officer]
Firearm number 20KG0637.

29:32.896 --> 29:34.397
Corporal Oh Hye-jin.

29:35.315 --> 29:36.524
- [clicks]
- Confirmed.

29:41.070 --> 29:42.363
[Cha Giho] That's right.

29:42.447 --> 29:44.073
We'll put out an APB.

29:45.575 --> 29:46.493
Now?

29:48.578 --> 29:49.496
Okay.

29:50.580 --> 29:54.125
The police are conducting a manhunt
for Do Gangjae and Kim Cheolho

29:54.209 --> 29:56.920
on suspicions of murder
and distribution of drugs.

29:57.003 --> 29:59.881
They've distributed
ten billion won's worth of LSD

29:59.964 --> 30:01.925
since November of last year.

30:02.008 --> 30:04.052
Moreover, they are under suspicion
of murdering

30:04.135 --> 30:06.513
four members of a competitor organization.

30:07.639 --> 30:09.808
The police are asking
for assistance from the public

30:09.891 --> 30:12.268
to capture these dangerous criminals.

30:15.104 --> 30:18.358
The government has issued
a new policy on real estate…

30:23.321 --> 30:25.281
Do Gangjae doesn't know we have you.

30:26.616 --> 30:28.952
First one who grab the phone
will have a different future.

30:33.748 --> 30:34.833
You take the phone,

30:35.458 --> 30:36.543
you're dead.

30:40.380 --> 30:41.756
The three of you, out.

30:42.799 --> 30:44.467
You hear him? Get up.

30:45.593 --> 30:47.262
Get up, you three! Get up!

30:48.096 --> 30:49.305
You. Get out.

30:50.682 --> 30:52.517
Motherfucker. Call and you're dead.

30:52.600 --> 30:54.018
[Daesoo] Get out of here. Out!

30:54.102 --> 30:55.061
[door opens]

30:55.144 --> 30:56.688
- Get out.
- [Pildo] Good thinking.

31:02.151 --> 31:03.152
[Sergeant Cho] Yoon Jiwoo.

31:05.196 --> 31:07.156
What are you doing with that girl, huh?

31:09.826 --> 31:11.244
She asked for this.

31:15.790 --> 31:16.833
You see,

31:18.251 --> 31:20.503
I've caught many bad guys,

31:21.713 --> 31:23.840
and you're a real demon, my friend.

31:27.302 --> 31:29.512
A junkie like you wouldn't get it.

31:31.890 --> 31:33.516
It's called conviction.

31:33.600 --> 31:34.434
[Sergeant Cho puffs]

31:36.144 --> 31:38.771
I don't know much
about shit like conviction.

31:39.272 --> 31:41.649
But the price of my silence has reason.

31:44.736 --> 31:45.737
[grunts]

31:46.279 --> 31:47.363
[inhales sharply]

31:48.823 --> 31:50.867
A few bags of drugs won't cut it.

31:52.619 --> 31:53.703
I see.

32:00.126 --> 32:02.086
You never disappoint me.

32:02.170 --> 32:03.004
Mm.

32:05.048 --> 32:07.967
Hey, Mr. Hwang. How thick is it?

32:08.051 --> 32:10.094
- [grunts]
- [Sergeant Cho groans]

32:10.178 --> 32:12.680
[Sergeant Cho] You son of a bitch. Fuck!

32:12.764 --> 32:14.057
You prick. Hey!

32:15.391 --> 32:17.810
I'm a detective, you son of a bitch.

32:17.894 --> 32:19.062
- Let me go!
- [rubber twangs]

32:19.145 --> 32:20.438
You son of a bitch.

32:20.521 --> 32:22.315
[Sergeant Cho retches]

32:23.691 --> 32:26.235
[choking]

32:26.319 --> 32:28.821
[choking continues]

32:30.907 --> 32:31.783
[groans]

32:33.826 --> 32:35.578
[chains rattling]

32:36.996 --> 32:38.706
[splashes]

32:44.253 --> 32:45.421
I just got here.

32:46.965 --> 32:49.175
- [man 3] Ha! Good job.
- Why are you paying him?

32:49.258 --> 32:50.760
I'm in a good mood.

33:01.145 --> 33:04.565
[Mango] So? You let her through,
you moron?

33:05.191 --> 33:06.275
Shit.

33:06.359 --> 33:07.360
Hang up.

33:07.860 --> 33:08.861
[Mango sighs]

33:08.945 --> 33:11.114
- [chair thuds]
- [Mango chuckles]

33:11.197 --> 33:13.741
Chair. Have a seat.

33:17.078 --> 33:19.288
[exhales deeply]
What now?

33:19.998 --> 33:22.917
Why do you bastards keep bugging me?
Goddamn it.

33:23.001 --> 33:25.128
You were the one
that sold me out to Gangjae.

33:29.632 --> 33:32.593
I only did because I was told to.

33:32.677 --> 33:33.761
[scoffs]

33:37.348 --> 33:38.474
This is a dilemma.

33:41.936 --> 33:44.605
How do I get rid of the guy
who tried to kill me?

33:50.570 --> 33:51.654
[sighs]

33:52.530 --> 33:55.408
I can be a cop and arrest you
for conspiracy to murder.

33:58.536 --> 34:00.621
Or I can leak it to Choi Mujin

34:00.705 --> 34:03.291
that you're Do Gangjae's puppet
who attacked his gym.

34:03.374 --> 34:04.584
I was not!

34:06.919 --> 34:08.337
All I did was get the drugs.

34:08.421 --> 34:09.714
[chuckles]

34:12.925 --> 34:14.886
But would Choi Mujin believe you?

34:17.597 --> 34:18.681
Yeah…

34:18.765 --> 34:20.308
That's the better option.

34:22.894 --> 34:25.354
It'll be a pain in the ass
to incriminate you.

34:25.438 --> 34:27.190
[Mango] Wait… Shit. Hold on.

34:30.443 --> 34:32.445
[breathing heavily]

34:35.323 --> 34:36.866
What do you want?

34:37.909 --> 34:38.951
Tell me.

34:41.913 --> 34:44.165
["My Name" playing]

34:45.792 --> 34:47.794
[cell phone vibrates]

34:57.178 --> 35:00.431
[Jiwoo] Do Gangjae is fleeing
the country by boat.

35:07.271 --> 35:12.443
♪ Hey, yeah, yeah, whoa ♪

35:13.861 --> 35:17.657
♪ Oh, whoa ♪

35:17.740 --> 35:21.536
♪ Oh, whoa ♪

35:22.578 --> 35:27.458
♪ Hey, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah ♪

35:33.881 --> 35:35.967
[cell phone vibrates]

35:40.179 --> 35:41.055
Yeah?

35:41.806 --> 35:43.224
[Gangjae] Captain Cha Giho?

35:44.183 --> 35:46.227
[foreboding music]

35:47.186 --> 35:48.437
This is Do Gangjae.

35:55.736 --> 35:58.030
Why? Turning yourself in?

35:59.657 --> 36:02.118
- [Gangjae] What? Like hell I am.
- Do Gangjae.

36:02.201 --> 36:03.411
[whispers]
Do Gangjae.

36:04.245 --> 36:06.706
[Gangjae] I'm just trying to help you out.

36:13.629 --> 36:15.464
You wanna catch Choi Mujin?

36:20.678 --> 36:22.346
I'll lead you to the guy…

36:24.223 --> 36:25.683
if you let me get out.

36:29.562 --> 36:31.731
[suspenseful music]

36:33.900 --> 36:34.984
[knife whooshes]

36:39.864 --> 36:41.490
[Taeju] Where did you get that intel?

36:42.742 --> 36:43.993
From Jiwoo.

36:45.536 --> 36:46.787
But what if it's a trap?

36:49.582 --> 36:50.958
You think too much.

36:53.961 --> 36:55.338
You suspect everything

36:56.297 --> 36:58.174
and look for the safest route.

37:00.301 --> 37:01.719
But we act now.

37:04.805 --> 37:06.140
I believe Jiwoo.

37:11.687 --> 37:12.855
You stay here.

37:16.108 --> 37:17.443
If anything goes wrong,

37:18.569 --> 37:20.696
someone must lead the organization.

37:27.286 --> 37:28.663
[door slides open]

37:29.664 --> 37:31.332
[door slides close]

37:39.215 --> 37:43.928
TO JIWOO, FROM DAD

37:59.694 --> 38:02.196
[upbeat music]

38:13.457 --> 38:14.375
[exhales deeply]

38:25.511 --> 38:27.346
[cell phone vibrates]

38:40.484 --> 38:42.194
[line ringing]

38:49.660 --> 38:51.662
- [radio beeps]
- [Gunpyeong] The cars are coming in.

38:56.834 --> 38:57.752
It's Choi Mujin.

38:59.003 --> 39:01.339
[tense music]

39:02.673 --> 39:04.425
- [radio beeps]
- [Gunpyeong] We're in position.

39:17.313 --> 39:19.940
JEON PILDO

39:20.858 --> 39:22.818
[cell phone vibrates]

39:23.903 --> 39:26.197
DETECTIVE OH HYEJIN

39:28.699 --> 39:31.243
[line ringing]

39:33.287 --> 39:35.247
[car engines revving]

39:35.831 --> 39:36.832
Shit.

39:37.458 --> 39:39.043
Stupid narcs.

39:57.645 --> 40:00.189
[suspenseful music]

40:00.940 --> 40:02.525
[Cha Giho] Don't move. Stay in position.

40:02.608 --> 40:03.943
Don't move. Stay in position.

40:09.907 --> 40:10.908
Gangjae.

40:12.910 --> 40:14.453
Walk over and say hi.

40:23.295 --> 40:24.672
I'm glad you're here.

40:26.841 --> 40:28.551
I thought I wouldn't see you.

40:35.808 --> 40:38.185
[gangsters shouting indistinctly]

40:39.854 --> 40:41.772
[all clamoring]

40:49.196 --> 40:51.198
[gangsters grunting]

40:58.080 --> 41:00.124
Captain. Should we move?

41:00.749 --> 41:03.252
[gangsters grunting]

41:03.335 --> 41:04.295
Captain!

41:07.715 --> 41:09.508
[groaning]

41:18.601 --> 41:20.436
[grunting]

41:23.856 --> 41:24.815
[groans]

41:31.947 --> 41:32.948
Should we move?

41:34.825 --> 41:35.993
[Mujin] Gangjae!

41:36.076 --> 41:38.621
[gangsters shouting indistinctly]

41:38.704 --> 41:40.623
[Cha Giho] Arrest them. Arrest them!

41:42.249 --> 41:44.168
- [gunshots]
- [gangsters grunting]

41:44.710 --> 41:45.628
Keep down!

41:45.711 --> 41:49.757
[sirens wailing]

41:51.425 --> 41:52.468
[gunshot]

41:54.386 --> 41:55.554
[grunts]

41:57.431 --> 42:00.267
[gangsters clamoring]

42:05.814 --> 42:07.399
[panting]

42:18.160 --> 42:19.662
- [gunshot]
- [groans]

42:19.745 --> 42:22.498
[all grunting]

42:29.296 --> 42:30.506
[gangsters groan]

42:34.468 --> 42:35.844
[gunshot]

42:38.556 --> 42:41.517
[thrilling music]

42:44.019 --> 42:45.271
[tires screech]

42:47.606 --> 42:48.691
[seat belt clicks]

42:55.739 --> 42:56.574
[grunts]

42:57.575 --> 42:59.076
It's a good day to die.

42:59.159 --> 43:00.411
[Mujin breathes heavily]

43:02.955 --> 43:04.290
Couldn't agree more.

43:10.546 --> 43:12.423
[Gangjae grunting]

43:14.216 --> 43:15.593
[groans]

43:16.093 --> 43:18.345
[both grunting]

43:18.429 --> 43:19.471
[groans]

43:20.222 --> 43:22.433
[panting]

43:22.516 --> 43:24.893
- Get over here, Gangjae.
- [groans]

43:24.977 --> 43:25.894
[grunts]

43:28.188 --> 43:30.190
[Gangjae panting]

43:31.650 --> 43:32.818
[Gangjae groans]

43:32.901 --> 43:34.862
[grunting]

43:37.114 --> 43:39.033
[grunting]

43:40.409 --> 43:41.327
[sucks teeth]

43:41.910 --> 43:43.162
- [groans]
- [grunts]

43:43.245 --> 43:44.413
[metal creaking]

43:45.039 --> 43:46.457
[growls]

43:50.919 --> 43:54.298
[heavy footsteps thudding]

44:01.805 --> 44:03.515
[breathing heavily]

44:04.058 --> 44:06.435
[Gangjae grunting]

44:08.854 --> 44:09.938
[groans]

44:11.565 --> 44:14.568
[grunts, pants]

44:15.694 --> 44:16.612
[screams]

44:21.700 --> 44:23.494
[grunts]
Shit.

44:23.577 --> 44:24.912
[Gangjae groans]

44:25.746 --> 44:27.289
[hisses, moans]

44:27.373 --> 44:30.334
[groans, pants]

44:32.503 --> 44:33.712
[Gangjae grunts]

44:33.796 --> 44:36.340
Fuck. Shit!
[groans]

44:36.423 --> 44:37.883
[chuckles]

44:37.966 --> 44:40.260
I wanted to live a fucking cool life.

44:40.969 --> 44:42.638
You made a foolish choice.

44:43.597 --> 44:44.973
[pants]

44:45.891 --> 44:47.476
So did you.

44:48.602 --> 44:51.438
- [screaming]
- [Mujin groaning]

45:01.490 --> 45:03.492
[Gangjae grunting]

45:06.954 --> 45:08.080
[knife clanks]

45:10.666 --> 45:12.084
[squelching]

45:12.167 --> 45:13.252
[breathes heavily]

45:14.336 --> 45:15.254
[groans]

45:16.171 --> 45:17.548
You let your guard down!

45:18.090 --> 45:19.466
[hysterical laugh]

45:19.550 --> 45:21.385
I won't die alone, you fucker!

45:21.468 --> 45:22.553
[gunshot]

45:23.762 --> 45:25.764
[breathes heavily]

45:28.892 --> 45:29.935
Hands up.

45:31.270 --> 45:33.188
[breathes heavily]

45:40.320 --> 45:41.447
Get out of here.

45:42.614 --> 45:43.449
Move it!

45:48.787 --> 45:49.872
[breathes heavily]

45:55.878 --> 45:58.881
[laughing]

45:59.798 --> 46:01.884
You stupid bitch.

46:02.468 --> 46:04.261
You don't know anything.

46:05.846 --> 46:06.889
Drop it.

46:07.598 --> 46:08.682
[Gangjae] Shoot.

46:09.600 --> 46:11.185
You said you'd kill me.

46:12.728 --> 46:13.937
So do it.

46:15.856 --> 46:16.857
Shoot.

46:18.066 --> 46:21.570
Do it!
[laughs]

46:22.154 --> 46:23.864
You can't, can you?

46:23.947 --> 46:25.908
Not anyone can fucking kill people.

46:26.492 --> 46:27.659
[Pildo] Put your gun down!

46:30.454 --> 46:31.663
[Gangjae] What will he do

46:32.247 --> 46:35.459
if he finds out you're Choi Mujin's peon?

46:36.794 --> 46:40.756
[breathing shakily]

46:44.426 --> 46:45.385
[groans]

46:47.137 --> 46:48.138
[grunts]

46:49.848 --> 46:50.891
[Cha Giho] Choi Mujin!

46:51.683 --> 46:54.311
[breathing heavily]

46:57.481 --> 46:59.149
Got you red-handed.

47:01.652 --> 47:03.570
- [engine revs]
- [gunshot]

47:03.654 --> 47:04.780
[tires screech]

47:13.580 --> 47:15.040
[pants]

47:16.250 --> 47:18.418
- [knife clanks]
- Hey, detective!

47:19.253 --> 47:20.796
[Gangjae] I'll turn myself in.

47:20.879 --> 47:22.464
[Pildo] Detective Oh, calm down.

47:22.548 --> 47:24.216
[breathes heavily]

47:24.925 --> 47:26.635
[Gangjae] I'll confess everything.

47:28.345 --> 47:30.305
And…
[gasps]

47:30.389 --> 47:33.058
- …Yoon Ji--
- [gunshots]

47:47.364 --> 47:49.700
[choking]

47:59.835 --> 48:00.794
Fuck…

48:00.878 --> 48:02.629
[breathes deeply]

48:06.633 --> 48:07.593
[chokes]

48:07.676 --> 48:09.511
Fucking bitch.

48:23.442 --> 48:25.527
[closing theme music]
